    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: SBQQ__QuoteLine__c records where an expired promo discount is still applied (end date in past, discount still present).
Why it matters: The customer pays the promo price after the promo period — direct margin loss on every billing cycle. Often results from QCP overrides that don&apos;t re-check promo dates.
Suppress a finding: when the customer has a documented promo extension.
Disable the detector: only if promos don&apos;t expire in your model. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
